# Implementation Plan - Hitting Mechanics & Back-of-Court Serve Overhaul

Overhaul the hitting mechanics, serving system, landing reticle trigger, Spacebar power charging, and visual feedback for the Ganesha Volleyball Game in React Three Fiber, making gameplay fluid and skill-based while preserving all visual style, court geometry, and 3D components.

